5,0,1,talk,Rin,,Hello everyone! I am so excited to start this adventure with you all.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,George,,Good morning. Let us proceed with caution and observe each other closely.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I am a bit nervous. Please be gentle with me.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"Welcome, dear children. Let us find peace and truth together.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,I hope we can all work well together. I love a good mystery!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Rin,,I think we should just talk and see who seems weird.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,George,,Agreed. Silence is often more telling than words.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,I don't know what to say. I just want to survive.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"That is a very honest sentiment, Daisuke. We are all here.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,I feel like George is being very serious. Is that suspicious?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Rin,,Maybe! Or maybe he's just old. I don't know.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,George,,My age is not a crime. I am simply experienced.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I'm sorry, George. I didn't mean to offend you.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"No offense taken, Rin. Let us keep our hearts open.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,I think we should vote for whoever seems the most aggressive.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Rin,,Okay! I'm ready for night. I hope I don't get eaten.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,George,,Rest well. The night reveals much.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,Goodnight. I will try to sleep.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Shizue,,"Goodnight, everyone. May the truth guide us.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Midori,,Goodnight. I'll dream of delicious food.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
