31,1,1,talk,Rin,,"Shizue, you looked at George last night, right? What did you see?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,George,,I was not looking at anyone. I was resting.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Rin, why are you asking that? It seems rude.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I have seen the darkness in one of our midst.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
