36,1,2,talk,Rin,,"So it's George? He looks so calm, but maybe that's the trick.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,George,,I am calm because I am innocent. Why do you suspect me?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
